Azure ExpressRoute

Azure ExpressRoute is a service that provides a private, dedicated connection between your on-premises network and Azure.

Key Points:
            Does not use the public internet
            More secure, reliable, and faster than VPN
            Offers low latency and high performance
Features:
          Private connection through a connectivity provider
          Supports large data transfers
          Consistent network performance
Connectivity Types:
                    On-premises to Azure (data center connection)
                    Branch offices to Azure
                    Can also connect to Microsoft services like Microsoft 365
When to Use:
            Need high security and privacy
            Large-scale or mission-critical workloads
            Require stable and predictable performance
            Comparison with VPN:
            ExpressRoute = private, dedicated connection
            VPN = encrypted over public internet
